<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>About | Superhero Database</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>

    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "application", "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
    <%= javascript_importmap_tags %>
    
    <style>
      .about-container {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 30px;
        background-color: #fff;
        border-radius: 15px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        text-align: center;
      }

      .about-title {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        color: #2c3e50;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .section-title {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        color: #333;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-top: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }

      .about-description,
      .schema-description {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: #555;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .data-sources {
        list-style-type: disc;
        margin-left: 20px;
        color: #333;
      }

      .data-sources li {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .custom-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-top: 15px;
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        border-radius: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .custom-table th, .custom-table td {
        padding: 12px 15px;
        text-align: left;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
      }

      .custom-table th {
        background-color: #3498db;
        color: white;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .custom-table tbody tr:nth-of-type(odd) {
        background-color: #f2f6f9;
      }

      .erd-image {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .erd-image img {
        max-width: 100%;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  
  <body>
    <div class="about-container">
      <h1 class="about-title">About the Superhero Database</h1>
      <p class="about-description">
        Welcome to the **Superhero Database**, a project designed to showcase an extensive collection of **Marvel and DC superheroes**.
        This application provides a structured way to **explore heroes, movies, TV shows, and games** while implementing features like search, filtering, and pagination.
      </p>

      <h2 class="section-title">Project Features</h2>
      <table class="custom-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Feature</th>
            <th>Description</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Superhero Profiles</td>
            <td>Displays names, images, origins, and affiliations of superheroes.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Movie & TV Show Info</td>
            <td>Links superheroes to their appearances in movies and TV shows.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Search & Filtering</td>
            <td>Allows users to search for heroes and filter results by publisher.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Like & Save</td>
            <td>Users can "like" superheroes and save their favorites.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Pagination</td>
            <td>Ensures smooth browsing of a large dataset.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="section-title">Data Sources</h2>
      <p class="about-description">
        The data in this project is collected from the **Superhero API**, combined with **Faker-generated users** and additional media sources.
      </p>
      <ul class="data-sources">
        <li>Superhero API - Fetches superhero data</li>
        <li>Faker Gem - Generates random user data</li>
        <li>Custom Movie, TV Show, and Game Data</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="section-title">Database Schema</h2>
      <p class="schema-description">
        The database is structured using **ActiveRecord** models with appropriate associations.
      </p>
      
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
